      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nongera kwunamura amaso, mbona imikogote ine iturutse hagati y’imisozi ibiri; kand’ iyo misozi yar’ imiringa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 1:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukogote wa mbere wakwegwa n’amafarasi y’utugajo; uwa kabiri wakwegwa n’amafarasi y’ imifyiri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uwa gatatu wakwegwa n’amafarasi y’ibitare; uwa kane wakwegwa n’amafarasi y’ibibamba mu tugajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko mbaza umumarayika twavugana, nt’ Ivyo bisobanurwa bite ga mugenzi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.104.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 104:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umumarayika aranyishura, at’ Ivyo n’imiyaga ine yo mw ijuru, ivuye gushengerera Nyen’ isi yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umukogote ukwegwa n’amafarasi y’imifyiri ugiye mu gihugu c’i burārūko, ay’ ibitare arayakurikiye; ay’ ibibamba na yo agiye mu gihugu c’i bumanuko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ay’ utugajo araza, asaba kugendagenda mw isi yose; aravuga, ati Nuko ni mugende, mugendagende mw isi yose nyene. Nukw agendagenda mw isi yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ arampamagara, arambarira, ati Rāba, ariya agiye mu gihugu c’i burārūko yaruhuye umutima wanje ku vy’ico gihugu c’i burārūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
